sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Reviewer A
    participant B as Reviewer B - old screen
    participant API as staff-api
    participant DB as apply_article_change
    A->>API: Open article - sees TECH_REVIEW, version 7
    B->>API: Open the same article - version 7
    A->>API: Approve, expecting TECH_REVIEW version 7
    API->>DB: Does status AND version still match?
    DB-->>API: Yes - LIT_REVIEW, version 8, audit event and emails saved
    API-->>A: Moved to Literature review
    B->>API: Reject, expecting TECH_REVIEW version 7
    API->>DB: Does status AND version still match?
    DB-->>API: No - it is now version 8
    API-->>B: Conflict - this article changed
    Note over B: Screen reloads with the latest version. B decides again with the new facts
